{"pharm":{"_comment":"Curated reference pharmacology for mechanism/AE prediction (predict.py). Keys match lexicon.json. evidence: clinical (human study / case reports) | in_vivo (animal) | in_vitro. Drug pathway roles: elimination | efflux | hepatic_uptake | activation | toxic_metabolite | toxicity_uptake | toxicity_efflux | gut_reactivation | cellular_uptake | mixed. Every entry is a hypothesis generator, not a clinical rule. All ref fields were checked against the PubMed record on 2026-10-26 and carry PMIDs; entries with no ref are general pharmacology and were not individually verified. observed_pairs with ae/direction also feed the AE ranking. Extend freely.","ae":{"neutropenia":{"label":"中性粒细胞减少/骨髓抑制","monitor":"血常规（ANC），必要时 G-CSF 预防"},"thrombocytopenia":{"label":"血小板减少","monitor":"血小板计数"},"diarrhea":{"label":"腹泻","monitor":"排便次数、脱水与电解质；备洛哌丁胺"},"nausea_vomiting":{"label":"恶心呕吐","monitor":"评估止吐方案"},"mucositis":{"label":"口腔/消化道黏膜炎","monitor":"口腔检查"},"hepatotoxicity":{"label":"肝损伤","monitor":"ALT/AST/胆红素（基线及每周期）"},"nephrotoxicity":{"label":"肾损伤","monitor":"血肌酐/eGFR、尿量，充分水化"},"cardiotoxicity":{"label":"心脏毒性（心功能下降）","monitor":"LVEF（超声心动）、心电图"},"arrhythmia":{"label":"QT 延长/心律失常","monitor":"心电图 QTc、血钾、血镁"},"peripheral_neuropathy":{"label":"周围神经病变","monitor":"神经症状分级"},"hypersensitivity":{"label":"输注/过敏反应","monitor":"输注监护、预处理，分开给药以便归因"},"fluid_retention":{"label":"水钠潴留/水肿","monitor":"体重、血压、水肿"},"hand_foot":{"label":"手足综合征/手足皮肤反应","monitor":"皮肤检查"},"rash":{"label":"皮疹","monitor":"皮肤检查"},"ild":{"label":"间质性肺病","monitor":"呼吸症状、胸部 CT"},"electrolyte_loss":{"label":"电解质紊乱（低钾/低镁）","monitor":"血钾、血镁"},"bleeding":{"label":"出血","monitor":"血小板、凝血功能（INR/APTT）、出血征象"},"hemorrhagic_cystitis":{"label":"出血性膀胱炎","monitor":"尿常规，美司钠/水化"},"ototoxicity":{"label":"耳毒性","monitor":"听力测定"},"constipation_ileus":{"label":"便秘/麻痹性肠梗阻","monitor":"排便情况"},"vte":{"label":"静脉血栓栓塞","monitor":"下肢肿痛、必要时超声"},"hypertension":{"label":"高血压","monitor":"血压"},"efficacy_loss":{"label":"疗效下降（暴露不足或药效拮抗）","monitor":"疗效评估；可行时做 TDM"}},"herbs":{"st_johns_wort":{"modulates":[{"target":"CYP3A4","effect":"induces","constituent":"hyperforin","evidence":"clinical","note":"PXR 激活；人体研究中显著降低多种 CYP3A4 底物暴露","ref":"Mathijssen 2002 J Natl Cancer Inst 94:1247 (PMID 12189228); Frye 2004 Clin Pharmacol Ther 76:323 (PMID 15470331)"},{"target":"P-gp","effect":"induces","constituent":"hyperforin","evidence":"clinical","note":"人体地高辛 AUC 下降 25%（连用 10 天后出现，单次给药无影响）","ref":"Johne 1999 Clin Pharmacol Ther 66:338 (PMID 10546917)"},{"target":"CYP2C19","effect":"induces","constituent":"hyperforin","evidence":"clinical","note":"人体奥美拉唑 AUC 下降 38–44%；同时诱导 CYP3A4 砜化与 CYP2C19 羟化","ref":"Wang 2004 Clin Pharmacol Ther 75:191 (PMID 15001970)"},{"target":"CYP2C9","effect":"induces","constituent":"hyperforin","evidence":"clinical","note":"S-华法林表观清除率升高 29%，INR 效应显著减弱","ref":"Jiang 2004 Br J Clin Pharmacol 57:592 (PMID 15089812)"},{"target":"CYP2B6","effect":"induces","constituent":"hyperforin","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"PXR/CAR 介导"}],"pd":[],"notes":["临床上最明确的“诱导型”草药；肿瘤患者一般建议避免合用。","同样会降低 CYP3A4 底物类支持药物（如阿瑞匹坦、地塞米松）的暴露。"]},"ginseng":{"modulates":[{"target":"CYP3A4","effect":"induces","constituent":"ginsenosides","evidence":"clinical","note":"健康志愿者连用 28 天，咪达唑仑 AUC 为用药前的 0.66 倍（约降 1/3）","ref":"Malati 2012 J Clin Pharmacol 52:932 (PMID 21646440)"},{"target":"CYP3A4","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"ginsenoside metabolites (e.g. compound K)","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"体外弱抑制；与人体诱导结果方向相反"},{"target":"P-gp","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"ginsenoside Rh2/Rg3","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"耐药细胞株中逆转 P-gp 外排；但同一人体研究中非索非那定 PK 未受影响，提示体内无明显 P-gp 效应","ref":"Malati 2012 J Clin Pharmacol 52:932 (PMID 21646440)"}],"pd":[{"effect":"anticoagulant_antiplatelet","evidence":"in_vivo","note":"人参皂苷抑制血小板聚集；但人体交叉试验中人参未改变华法林 PK/PD，也未影响血小板聚集，临床证据弱","ref":"Jiang 2004 Br J Clin Pharmacol 57:592 (PMID 15089812)"},{"effect":"estrogenic","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"个案报道绝经后出血/乳腺症状；ER 活性证据不一致"},{"effect":"immunostimulant","evidence":"in_vivo","note":""}],"notes":["制剂差异大（红参/白参、皂苷含量），PK 方向不一致。"]},"american_ginseng":{"modulates":[],"pd":[{"effect":"immunostimulant","evidence":"in_vivo","note":""}],"notes":["III 期 RCT 用于癌因性疲乏：2,000 mg/日，8 周时优于安慰剂（P=0.003）；4 周的主要终点未达显著（P=0.07）——Barton 2013 J Natl Cancer Inst 105:1230 (PMID 23853057)。与化疗药的药代相互作用证据很少。","随机对照试验显示会减弱华法林的抗凝作用（INR 峰值下降）——Yuan 2004 Ann Intern Med 141:23 (PMID 15238367)。"]},"astragalus":{"modulates":[{"target":"CYP3A4","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"formononetin/calycosin","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"体外弱抑制，临床意义不明"},{"target":"P-gp","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"astragaloside IV","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"耐药细胞株中下调 P-gp"}],"pd":[{"effect":"myeloprotective","evidence":"clinical","note":"多项 meta 分析报告骨髓抑制减轻，但原始 RCT 质量偏低"},{"effect":"immunostimulant","evidence":"in_vivo","note":""},{"effect":"estrogenic","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"异黄酮（芒柄花素、毛蕊异黄酮）具植物雌激素活性"}],"notes":[]},"licorice":{"modulates":[{"target":"CYP3A4","effect":"induces","constituent":"glycyrrhizin","evidence":"in_vivo","note":"大鼠中诱导 CYP3A"},{"target":"CYP3A4","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"glabridin","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"体外机制性抑制"}],"pd":[{"effect":"pseudoaldosteronism","evidence":"clinical","note":"甘草酸/甘草次酸抑制 11β-HSD2 → 低钾、高血压、水肿；剂量与疗程依赖"},{"effect":"estrogenic","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"光甘草定、异甘草素弱雌激素活性"}],"notes":["复方中常见；累计甘草酸剂量是低钾风险的关键。"]},"scutellaria":{"modulates":[{"target":"gut_beta_glucuronidase","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"baicalin/baicalein","evidence":"in_vivo","note":"抑制肠道菌 β-葡萄糖醛酸酶，减少 SN-38G 在肠腔再活化为 SN-38"},{"target":"CYP3A4","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"baicalein/wogonin","evidence":"in_vitro","note":""},{"target":"CYP2C9","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"baicalein","evidence":"in_vitro","note":""},{"target":"P-gp","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"baicalein","evidence":"in_vitro","note":""}],"pd":[{"effect":"hepatotoxic","evidence":"clinical","note":"LiverTox 收录黄芩相关药物性肝损伤病例"}],"notes":[]},"curcuma":{"modulates":[{"target":"ABCG2"