 (PMID 21870106)"},{"target":"CYP2C9","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"berberine","evidence":"clinical","note":"同一研究中氯沙坦/E-3174 比值翻倍（代谢下降）","ref":"Guo 2012 Eur J Clin Pharmacol 68:213 (PMID 21870106)"}],"pd":[],"notes":["CYP2D6 抑制对他莫昔芬（需 CYP2D6 活化为 endoxifen）尤其重要。"]},"rhubarb":{"modulates":[{"target":"OAT1","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"rhein","evidence":"in_vitro","note":""},{"target":"OAT3","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"rhein","evidence":"in_vitro","note":""}],"pd":[{"effect":"laxative","evidence":"clinical","note":"蒽醌类泻下作用"},{"effect":"nephrotoxic","evidence":"in_vivo","note":"长期大剂量蒽醌的动物肾毒性"}],"notes":["长期使用可致低钾（经肠道丢失）。"]},"green_tea":{"modulates":[{"target":"P-gp","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"EGCG","evidence":"in_vitro","note":""},{"target":"CYP3A4","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"EGCG","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"人体探针研究未见明显影响：脱咖啡因绿茶提取物连用 14 天，阿普唑仑与右美沙芬 PK 均无变化","ref":"Donovan 2004 Drug Metab Dispos 32:906 (PMID 15319329)"}],"pd":[{"effect":"hepatotoxic","evidence":"clinical","note":"高剂量绿茶提取物相关肝损伤（饮用茶水风险低）"},{"effect":"antioxidant_high_dose","evidence":"in_vitro","note":""}],"notes":["EGCG 等含邻苯二酚结构的绿茶多酚可与硼酸类蛋白酶体抑制剂（硼替佐米）直接结合使其失活，体外与小鼠体内均可抵消其抗肿瘤作用；非硼酸类蛋白酶体抑制剂不受影响——Golden 2009 Blood 113:5927 (PMID 19190249)。"]},"milk_thistle":{"modulates":[{"target":"CYP2C9","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"silybin","evidence":"clinical","note":"人体氯沙坦向 E-3174 的代谢下降，CYP2C9*1/*1 者更明显","ref":"Han 2009 Eur J Clin Pharmacol 65:585 (PMID 19221727)"},{"target":"CYP3A4","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"silybin","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"人体研究未见明显影响：伊立替康清除率不变；水飞蓟素连用 28 天对 CYP3A4/2D6/2E1/1A2 表型指标均无影响","ref":"van Erp 2005 Clin Cancer Res 11:7800 (PMID 16278402); Gurley 2004 Clin Pharmacol Ther 76:428 (PMID 15536458)"},{"target":"UGT1A1","effect":"inhibits","constituent":"silybin","evidence":"in_vitro","note":"人体伊立替康研究中 SN-38 葡萄糖醛酸化程度未见明显变化；血浆水飞蓟宾浓度过低（≤0.26 μM），不足以在体内抑制该酶","ref":"van Erp 2005 Clin Cancer Res 11:7800 (PMID 16278402)"}],"pd":[],"notes":[]},"ganoder